name: Droll Joker — flush mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Droll Joker gives +10 Mult if the hand contains a Flush. First-shop flush payoff:
  Smeared (2 effective suits) and Four Fingers make Flushes easy; level with Jupiter
  and stack The Tribe (X2 on Flush).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: DrollJoker
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: TheTribe
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 35
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 30
  - planetCard: Jupiter
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 20
